WEBVTT

01:30.360 --> 01:34.810
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.150 --> 01:37.789
[Episode 34]

01:50.310 --> 01:51.560
My wish is

01:52.470 --> 01:54.000
to see Hong Ye again.

02:00.640 --> 02:01.770
When did you arrive?

02:02.840 --> 02:03.970
I was just passing by

02:04.430 --> 02:06.610
and saw you standing here alone.

02:09.280 --> 02:11.210
My wounds have healed completely.

02:11.510 --> 02:12.570
I came to thank you.

02:16.960 --> 02:17.890
Where's my gift?

02:18.990 --> 02:21.320
A thank-you isn't sincere without a gift.

02:35.800 --> 02:37.150
This is...?

02:37.310 --> 02:38.640
This is a mermaid pearl.

02:38.870 --> 02:40.400
It holds great life energy.

02:40.430 --> 02:41.490
In times of crisis,

02:41.690 --> 02:42.890
it can save your life.

02:43.810 --> 02:45.340
I know your power is strong,

02:45.570 --> 02:46.500
but just in case.

02:48.090 --> 02:49.350
So, you're saying that

02:50.000 --> 02:51.730
you just happened to come here,

02:51.730 --> 02:53.640
today just happens to be my birthday,

02:53.640 --> 02:55.770
you just happened to have a gift with you,

02:55.770 --> 02:57.240
and this bracelet

02:57.240 --> 02:59.100
just happens to fit me perfectly?

03:02.170 --> 03:03.610
This might just be

03:05.350 --> 03:06.110
fate.

03:11.150 --> 03:13.190
The merfolk are known for bad tempers.

03:13.190 --> 03:14.750
I imagine this mermaid pearl

03:14.750 --> 03:16.010
wasn't easy to obtain.

03:19.560 --> 03:21.020
We barely know each other.

03:21.329 --> 03:22.400
Why would I deliberately

03:22.400 --> 03:24.200
prepare a birthday gift for you?

03:24.710 --> 03:26.530
I, Ao Hen, repay kindness

03:26.670 --> 03:27.800
and avenge grudges.

03:28.210 --> 03:29.740
Don't read too much into it.

03:29.870 --> 03:31.240
Thank you for your gift.

03:51.000 --> 03:51.850
Xiao Yao!

03:52.190 --> 03:53.310
It's my birthday today.

03:53.310 --> 03:54.310
I won't accept any challenges

03:54.310 --> 03:55.570
or get into any fights.

03:55.800 --> 03:57.470
Of course I know it's your birthday.

03:57.470 --> 04:00.070
I came especially
to bring you a birthday gift.

04:05.190 --> 04:07.080
No wonder he couldn't
catch up to the Dragon Lord.

04:07.080 --> 04:08.670
Look at this Heaven-Shattering Hammer.

04:08.670 --> 04:10.340
It's forged from a meteor.

04:10.660 --> 04:11.640
One strike

04:11.980 --> 04:13.640
can flatten a small mountain.

04:21.360 --> 04:22.019
And this...

04:22.120 --> 04:23.240
The Adamant Shield

04:23.700 --> 04:25.760
is forged from Que Mountain crystal.

04:26.810 --> 04:27.520
It can attack

04:27.520 --> 04:28.200
and defend.

04:28.550 --> 04:29.730
Attack and defend.

04:29.940 --> 04:30.590
It can...

04:30.870 --> 04:31.390
Can...

04:32.080 --> 04:33.540
It's just a pot.

04:34.300 --> 04:36.159
You'll definitely like this one.

04:39.680 --> 04:41.540
This is the Golden Chiming Spear,

04:41.610 --> 04:43.220
one of my favorites.

04:44.510 --> 04:46.440
A thrust sounds like a phoenix cry.

04:46.680 --> 04:47.880
A sweeping strike...

04:48.000 --> 04:49.600
sounds like a dragon's roar.

04:50.360 --> 04:51.950
What an awful sound.

04:51.950 --> 04:54.350
How could you liken that
to a dragon's roar?

04:57.310 --> 04:58.180
Thank you.

04:58.270 --> 04:59.800
But do you think

04:59.800 --> 05:01.310
I still need weapons?

05:03.070 --> 05:04.310
Of course these weapons

05:04.310 --> 05:06.630
are prepared for weaker species.

05:06.920 --> 05:08.800
Great demons like us don't need them.

05:08.800 --> 05:10.600
Just treat them as accessories.

05:10.630 --> 05:12.230
Though your power is strong,

05:12.240 --> 05:13.640
you're small in stature.

05:17.360 --> 05:18.120
Holding these

05:18.120 --> 05:19.870
looks more impressive
than being empty-handed.

05:19.870 --> 05:21.400
It'll make others fear you.

05:21.630 --> 05:23.090
I appreciate the thought.

05:25.070 --> 05:25.870
There's more.

05:30.830 --> 05:31.670
This bow

05:31.800 --> 05:33.480
is said to have been
left behind by Hou Yi.

05:33.480 --> 05:35.920
Just channel your power
into the bowstring,

05:35.920 --> 05:38.780
and even without arrows,
it can pierce heavy armor.

05:40.140 --> 05:40.920
That's right.

05:40.920 --> 05:43.120
Channel your power into the bowstring.

05:43.310 --> 05:45.090
Decide on a target in your mind.

05:46.920 --> 05:47.600
Yao!

05:47.750 --> 05:48.350
Disperse!

05:51.920 --> 05:52.800
Are you okay?

05:56.630 --> 05:57.570
Yao,

05:57.750 --> 05:58.810
for your birthday,

05:58.870 --> 06:01.560
are you planning to kill
a great demon for entertainment?

06:01.560 --> 06:02.860
Why so petty?

06:03.000 --> 06:04.330
I didn't hurt you, did I?

06:04.510 --> 06:05.920
I haven't finished the one
you gave me last time,

06:05.920 --> 06:07.480
and now you're bringing a new one again.

06:07.480 --> 06:08.880
Didn't we make a promise?

06:09.270 --> 06:11.560
To enjoy good food
and drinks together forever?

06:11.560 --> 06:12.920
When I find something good,

06:12.920 --> 06:15.000
I'll bring it to you right away.

06:15.240 --> 06:15.680
Hmm.

06:19.190 --> 06:19.920
Forever?

06:22.240 --> 06:23.420
Of course.

06:23.830 --> 06:25.630
That's my promise with Yao.

06:26.680 --> 06:27.240
Long Zhi.

06:27.680 --> 06:28.930
Set the table.

06:29.040 --> 06:31.300
I'll share this fine wine with these two.

06:32.430 --> 06:34.430
Thank you both for coming to celebrate
my birthday today.

06:34.430 --> 06:36.560
I, Xiao Yao, toast to you both.

06:38.830 --> 06:39.480
Yao.

06:40.240 --> 06:42.700
He's not the one you have feelings for,
is he?

06:43.390 --> 06:44.480
He's just a brute

06:44.950 --> 06:46.120
who isn't worthy of you at all.

06:46.120 --> 06:47.380
What are you thinking?

06:48.870 --> 06:49.510
Xiao Yao,

06:49.920 --> 06:51.850
even if you have someone you fancy,

06:51.920 --> 06:54.920
you should still be mindful of your status
as a dragon.

06:56.050 --> 06:58.560
If we're talking about suitable matches,

06:58.630 --> 06:59.480
us vine serpents

06:59.480 --> 07:01.530
at least share ancestry with the dragons.

07:01.530 --> 07:03.070
But you Qiongqis

07:03.070 --> 07:03.750
are simply

07:03.750 --> 07:06.560
worlds apart from us.

07:06.560 --> 07:07.380
You

07:07.720 --> 07:09.480
have never taken cultivation seriously,

07:09.480 --> 07:11.270
and only know how to play all day.

07:11.270 --> 07:13.270
How dare you claim shared ancestry?

07:14.480 --> 07:15.510
No matter how high one's cultivation,

07:15.510 --> 07:17.120
without true spiritual connection,

07:17.120 --> 07:19.410
you'll eventually part ways anyway.

07:22.680 --> 07:23.870
She's an Azure Dragon.

07:23.870 --> 07:24.920
Being with you

07:24.920 --> 07:26.320
would only hold her back!

07:27.070 --> 07:27.800
Who are you?

07:27.800 --> 07:29.130
Why do you get to decide?

07:30.600 --> 07:31.920
Enough, both of you!

07:31.920 --> 07:33.360
He spits in my face every time.

07:33.360 --> 07:34.580
So what if he spits in your face?

07:34.580 --> 07:36.120
You're spitting in the food!

07:36.120 --> 07:37.780
Who told you to spit? Sit down!

07:38.480 --> 07:39.010
Sit down!

07:42.800 --> 07:44.390
It's my birthday today.

07:44.390 --> 07:46.050
Are you here to cause trouble?

07:49.080 --> 07:51.100
If you really want to give me gifts,

07:51.390 --> 07:53.270
then go find things I haven't seen before.

07:53.270 --> 07:54.670
Something fresh and new.

07:58.720 --> 08:00.920
We've all lived for thousands of years.

08:00.950 --> 08:02.830
What could there be that we haven't seen?

08:02.830 --> 08:04.630
That depends on your abilities.

08:06.190 --> 08:07.000
Yao,

08:07.510 --> 08:09.040
then does that

08:09.040 --> 08:11.170
Lantern Grass from last time count?

08:11.750 --> 08:12.680
It does.

08:12.750 --> 08:14.810
But this time I want something newer.

08:15.120 --> 08:16.190
No problem.

08:16.210 --> 08:16.870
Wait for me-

08:18.040 --> 08:19.040
Goodbye, Yao!

08:19.040 --> 08:19.750
Goodbye.

08:20.810 --> 08:21.540
Xiao Yao.

08:24.160 --> 08:24.890
Don't worry.

08:25.850 --> 08:27.380
Before your birthday ends,

08:27.720 --> 08:29.980
I'll definitely find something for you.

08:33.000 --> 08:35.130
Oh my heavens.

08:47.870 --> 08:51.270
Happy birthday, Dragon Lord!

08:51.750 --> 08:52.840
We've been preparing for days

08:52.840 --> 08:54.170
and hope you'll like it.

08:55.790 --> 08:56.390
Come in!

08:59.270 --> 09:00.150
What is this?

09:00.440 --> 09:02.440
You said you wanted to find some humans,

09:02.440 --> 09:03.040
so we

09:03.200 --> 09:05.400
arranged a little performance for you.

09:24.360 --> 09:25.840
This is the final trial.

09:25.860 --> 09:27.440
When only one is left standing,

09:27.440 --> 09:29.000
the trial will be completed.

09:29.000 --> 09:29.630
Begin.

09:34.030 --> 09:34.730
Long Zhi!

09:34.760 --> 09:35.600
These three

09:35.600 --> 09:37.390
killed their way through a hundred humans.

09:37.390 --> 09:39.480
They're considered quite capable
among the humans.

09:39.480 --> 09:40.360
Killed?

09:40.390 --> 09:41.910
We captured a hundred humans

09:41.910 --> 09:43.860
and told them only one would live.

09:43.990 --> 09:46.440
If they live, they get to serve
the Dragon Lord.

09:46.440 --> 09:48.030
Being able to serve the Dragon Lord alive

09:48.030 --> 09:49.430
is their greatest honor.

10:13.790 --> 10:14.480
Hong Ye!

10:15.360 --> 10:17.220
Biting off more than you can chew.

10:22.510 --> 10:23.910
Quick, put him on the bed.

10:28.120 --> 10:28.790
Do it now!

10:54.670 --> 10:55.480
Dragon Lord.

10:55.600 --> 10:56.440
Humans are weak.

10:56.440 --> 10:57.670
If you force power into him

10:57.670 --> 10:58.480
in his current condition,

10:58.480 --> 11:00.610
he definitely won't be able to take it.

11:02.200 --> 11:03.440
What should we do then?

11:03.440 --> 11:05.440
I didn't expect him to be so fragile.

11:07.550 --> 11:08.310
Dragon Lord,

11:08.750 --> 11:10.670
what's so special about this human

11:10.670 --> 11:12.400
that you care so much about him?

11:14.150 --> 11:16.760
I only punished him
because he offended you.

11:17.200 --> 11:18.910
Please forgive me, Dragon Lord.

11:18.910 --> 11:19.670
Dragon Lord,

11:19.790 --> 11:21.530
humans are weak and have short lives.

11:21.530 --> 11:22.390
Even if you save him,

11:22.390 --> 11:23.620
he won't live long.

11:23.960 --> 11:25.290
Whether he lives or dies

11:25.600 --> 11:26.930
is for Heaven to decide,

11:27.360 --> 11:28.200
not you or me.

11:28.400 --> 11:28.960
But-

11:35.680 --> 11:37.710
You claim to protect all beings,

11:38.150 --> 11:40.570
yet you never count humans among them.

11:40.960 --> 11:42.750
When demons treat humans this way,

11:42.750 --> 11:44.680
have you ever thought about karma?

11:45.000 --> 11:46.180
One day in the future,

11:46.180 --> 11:48.310
humans will treat demons the same way.

11:48.630 --> 11:49.910
Humans are lowly and incapable.

11:49.910 --> 11:51.910
How could they ever be above demons?

11:53.200 --> 11:55.510
You said yourself you wanted a human.

11:55.510 --> 11:57.240
We were just following orders.

11:57.630 --> 11:58.960
Were we wrong for that?

12:01.670 --> 12:02.480
Leave.

12:04.270 --> 12:05.670
But this is your bedchamber.

12:05.670 --> 12:07.030
How can we leave him here?

12:07.030 --> 12:07.550
Let's go.

12:07.550 --> 12:08.200
What?

12:13.270 --> 12:14.790
It's just a human.

12:15.150 --> 12:17.350
If the Dragon Lord likes him,
let her be.

12:18.080 --> 12:20.000
But tribulation is so dangerous.

12:20.480 --> 12:22.510
Even the Dragon Lord has lost her mind.

12:22.510 --> 12:24.240
When it's my turn to face tribulation,

12:24.240 --> 12:25.900
will I even be able to survive?

12:27.390 --> 12:28.360
Relax.

12:28.360 --> 12:29.360
Your tribulation

12:29.360 --> 12:31.200
won't come for another thousand years.

12:31.200 --> 12:32.600
According to the Dragon Lord,

12:32.600 --> 12:33.440
by then,

12:33.440 --> 12:35.270
humans will be more powerful than you

12:35.270 --> 12:37.930
and will have already captured you
as a servant.

13:09.600 --> 13:12.880
♪ Fear that the red thread that bound us,
the vows we engraved ♪

13:13.850 --> 13:17.110
♪ The "forever" we swore are
meant to miss their mark ♪

13:23.600 --> 13:26.980
♪ Afraid of the exchanged life and death,
the arrows blocking the way ♪

13:27.880 --> 13:32.170
♪ The chains that are hard to break,
hard to distinguish ♪

13:35.600 --> 13:37.880
♪ Perhaps it's all for nothing ♪

13:39.080 --> 13:41.340
♪ Love and hate are nothing more ♪

13:42.380 --> 13:46.590
♪ Than a scene we rush through ♪

13:43.080 --> 13:45.030
You protected me time and again.

13:48.960 --> 13:50.600
Now I can too.

13:49.830 --> 13:52.120
♪ Afraid of giving my true heart ♪

13:51.270 --> 13:53.750
I can protect you
the way you protected me.

13:53.120 --> 13:55.550
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

13:56.600 --> 13:58.270
I'm an Azure Dragon now,

13:58.010 --> 13:59.990
♪ Boiling hot ♪

13:59.000 --> 14:00.400
the most powerful demon.

14:04.780 --> 14:09.060
♪ You and I are like grass and trees
meeting in the depths of the clouds ♪

14:05.720 --> 14:07.270
Wake up quickly.

14:09.970 --> 14:14.260
♪ Like the red thread strung together,
hanging on a sharp sword ♪

14:10.750 --> 14:13.120
See how powerful your Xiao Yao has become.

14:15.320 --> 14:18.120
♪ Waiting for the heartbeat
to shatter time ♪

14:19.320 --> 14:20.790
♪ The chains of fate ♪

14:21.780 --> 14:25.280
♪ Belong to us, in the blink of an eye,
it's 1,000 years ♪

14:26.330 --> 14:29.920
♪ You and I meet across mountains
and rivers, under the bright moon ♪

14:28.720 --> 14:29.510
Hong Ye.

14:30.760 --> 14:32.180
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

14:31.960 --> 14:32.470
Water.

14:33.380 --> 14:34.670
♪ Both flushing ♪

14:35.740 --> 14:39.310
♪ Waiting to walk hand in hand
through the chessboard of fate ♪

14:37.510 --> 14:38.240
Water.

14:39.840 --> 14:40.360
Water.

14:40.390 --> 14:45.310
♪ The carefree moments that belong to us ♪

14:47.680 --> 14:49.550
♪ Moments ♪

15:12.510 --> 15:13.960
The Dragon Lord actually let that human

15:13.960 --> 15:15.440
live in her own chamber

15:15.630 --> 15:17.430
and moved herself to a side hall.

15:18.040 --> 15:19.650
He's just a mere human.

15:19.720 --> 15:22.120
Why is the Dragon Lord
treating him so well?

15:22.440 --> 15:23.240
If you ask me,

15:23.510 --> 15:24.360
the Dragon Lord just thinks

15:24.360 --> 15:26.320
keeping cats or dogs is too boring,

15:26.440 --> 15:28.700
so she's keeping a human as a pet instead.

16:20.090 --> 16:20.840
Hong Ye.

16:22.230 --> 16:23.090
Hong Ye.

16:23.660 --> 16:24.460
You're awake.

16:28.770 --> 16:30.170
Your fever has gone down.

16:31.320 --> 16:32.700
When did you wake up?

16:32.750 --> 16:34.350
Why didn't saying anything?

16:34.600 --> 16:35.000
Here,

16:35.360 --> 16:36.360
drink some water.

16:39.140 --> 16:40.070
Are you alright?

16:40.240 --> 16:41.300
Don't come closer!

16:44.720 --> 16:46.520
Why do you always want to kill me?

16:46.960 --> 16:47.670
Why?

16:48.390 --> 16:49.390
Why do you think?

16:50.720 --> 16:52.520
You demons force humans

16:53.080 --> 16:54.950
to kill each other for your amusement.

16:54.950 --> 16:57.410
Thousands of people have died
by your hands.

16:58.150 --> 16:59.960
Don't you deserve to die?

17:05.310 --> 17:05.750
Come.

17:06.030 --> 17:07.359
Drink some water first.

17:07.960 --> 17:08.819
I don't want it!

17:11.640 --> 17:12.400
They say

17:13.480 --> 17:14.480
the winner

17:15.400 --> 17:17.730
gets the honor of serving the Dragon Lord.

17:23.400 --> 17:25.069
I would rather die

17:26.569 --> 17:28.640
than accept such an honor.

17:31.000 --> 17:31.880
Then die.

17:32.240 --> 17:32.960
I'll watch.

17:36.070 --> 17:37.370
You still have unfinished business,

17:37.370 --> 17:39.430
and aren't willing to die now, right?

17:41.680 --> 17:43.440
Whether you have someone you miss

17:43.440 --> 17:44.740
or a revenge unpaid,

17:45.510 --> 17:47.830
they're all reasons for you to stay alive.

17:47.830 --> 17:49.640
Otherwise, you wouldn't still be standing

17:49.640 --> 17:51.500
after fighting a hundred others.

17:53.400 --> 17:54.270
My revenge

17:56.330 --> 17:58.390
is the revenge of all humans.

17:59.830 --> 18:01.320
Then heal yourself first

18:01.350 --> 18:03.150
before thinking about revenge.

18:08.710 --> 18:10.040
You are the Dragon Lord.

18:12.020 --> 18:14.920
You're allowing me
to seek revenge against the demons?

18:14.920 --> 18:16.030
What do you want?

18:18.330 --> 18:20.130
What do you think I want from you?

19:06.590 --> 19:08.540
Now I can understand

19:09.110 --> 19:12.110
how Hong Ye felt
when he first entered Demons' Valley.

19:42.000 --> 19:42.640
Hong Ye.

19:51.030 --> 19:52.310
You've just barely survived.

19:52.310 --> 19:53.590
Why are you moving around?

19:53.590 --> 19:54.590
Just lie down.

19:55.920 --> 19:57.180
With this body of mine,

19:57.960 --> 20:00.020
I can't serve the Dragon Lord anyway.

20:00.550 --> 20:02.750
There's no purpose in keeping me alive.

20:03.270 --> 20:04.550
Let me go.

20:05.720 --> 20:08.520
You're not to leave
until you're fully recovered.

20:10.000 --> 20:11.930
I have more important things to do.

20:14.270 --> 20:15.440
I must leave.

20:16.480 --> 20:17.270
Hong Ye.

20:20.640 --> 20:21.680
I saved your life.

20:22.000 --> 20:23.930
You need to repay this debt, right?

20:25.880 --> 20:27.640
What exactly do you want?

20:30.550 --> 20:32.150
Heal your wounds and then go.

20:52.480 --> 20:53.790
If you want to recover faster,

20:53.790 --> 20:55.160
you need to walk around.

21:02.200 --> 21:03.330
I can walk by myself.

21:08.430 --> 21:09.750
Then you have to be careful.

21:09.750 --> 21:11.070
If you get hurt,

21:11.070 --> 21:13.000
I'll have to take care of you again.

21:20.670 --> 21:22.370
I don't need your care.

21:40.200 --> 21:40.750
Hong Ye!

21:41.720 --> 21:43.950
The Dragon Lord is too nice to that human.

21:43.950 --> 21:45.710
Good thing it's just a surface wound.

21:45.710 --> 21:47.840
Otherwise, you'd be suffering again.

21:53.270 --> 21:53.920
Why?

21:56.640 --> 21:58.500
Why are you treating me like this?

21:59.480 --> 22:00.720
You're not killing me

22:01.200 --> 22:02.480
or letting me leave,

22:02.880 --> 22:04.940
and you even take such good care of me.

22:07.070 --> 22:08.640
I really don't understand.

22:12.400 --> 22:13.750
Perhaps the fate between us

22:13.750 --> 22:15.210
has not yet run its course.

22:19.070 --> 22:21.150
Perhaps one day, humans will

22:21.640 --> 22:23.040
be stronger than demons.

22:23.880 --> 22:25.220
If that day comes,

22:25.350 --> 22:27.490
I hope you'll remember our bond

22:27.720 --> 22:29.250
and not try to stab me again.

22:34.030 --> 22:35.290
Stronger than demons.

22:37.270 --> 22:37.720
Yes.

22:38.560 --> 22:41.110
True strength doesn't
come from external power,

22:41.110 --> 22:42.470
but from within.

22:43.110 --> 22:44.720
Since humans exist in this world,

22:44.720 --> 22:46.520
they must have their strengths.

22:47.030 --> 22:47.700
Otherwise,

22:48.160 --> 22:50.070
with demons oppressing humans for so long,

22:50.070 --> 22:52.130
humans would have vanished long ago.

22:52.910 --> 22:53.910
Isn't that right?

23:09.240 --> 23:10.540
From now on,

23:10.830 --> 23:12.170
no matter where you are,

23:12.590 --> 23:14.190
you must not belittle humans

23:14.380 --> 23:16.340
or take human lives without cause.

23:16.790 --> 23:18.700
Hong Ye will stay here to recover

23:18.720 --> 23:20.120
until he's fully healed.

23:20.350 --> 23:21.410
During this time,

23:21.480 --> 23:22.720
all his needs

23:22.790 --> 23:24.450
must be attended to with care.

23:24.880 --> 23:27.000
Treat him as you would treat me.

23:27.270 --> 23:28.430
Is that understood?

23:28.550 --> 23:29.440
Yes.

23:29.720 --> 23:30.240
Yes.

23:35.170 --> 23:36.920
I heard you asked for some pearls.

23:36.920 --> 23:37.960
Do you need anything else?

23:37.960 --> 23:38.790
Just ask.

23:39.590 --> 23:40.450
This is enough.

23:40.950 --> 23:42.410
I just did something small

23:42.640 --> 23:44.040
to show my appreciation.

23:45.460 --> 23:46.090
For me?

23:46.190 --> 23:46.660
Yes.

23:46.960 --> 23:48.640
I ground the pearls into powder

23:48.640 --> 23:50.000
and added some warm water.

23:50.000 --> 23:51.200
If you soak your hands in it,

23:51.200 --> 23:52.600
it'll nourish your skin.

23:53.110 --> 23:54.310
Would you like to try?

23:59.880 --> 24:00.860
If I do this,

24:01.480 --> 24:03.410
will it make the Dragon Lord happy?

24:03.720 --> 24:04.920
Just call me Xiao Yao.

24:05.880 --> 24:07.200
As long as you don't insist on leaving,

24:07.200 --> 24:09.130
anything you do will make me happy.

24:09.310 --> 24:10.070
Xiao Yao.

24:12.660 --> 24:13.390
How dare you!

24:18.640 --> 24:19.270
Long Yu!

24:19.550 --> 24:20.900
You dare try to assassinate
the Dragon Lord?

24:20.900 --> 24:22.020
I'll kill you!

24:24.440 --> 24:25.270
Dragon Lord!

24:25.550 --> 24:27.010
He tried to kill you twice.

24:27.070 --> 24:28.610
Why are you protecting him?

24:28.640 --> 24:30.440
I said he wasn't to be harmed.

24:30.580 --> 24:32.260
Do my words mean nothing to you?

24:32.260 --> 24:32.960
Apologize!

24:35.500 --> 24:36.910
He's human!

24:40.720 --> 24:41.520
You're right.

24:41.570 --> 24:43.320
Words aren't sincere enough.

24:43.590 --> 24:46.790
You should suffer the same pain as him
to truly apologize.

24:47.850 --> 24:48.640
Dragon Lord.

24:49.600 --> 24:50.590
Because of him,

24:51.030 --> 24:53.140
you don't care about me anymore?

24:53.300 --> 24:55.590
Normally, I can reason with you kindly,

24:56.160 --> 24:57.070
but I can also

24:57.070 --> 24:59.470
be stern and teach you
the meaning of rules.

25:35.010 --> 25:36.680
Now, can you tell me

25:37.500 --> 25:39.700
why you've repeatedly tried to kill me?

25:45.550 --> 25:46.820
I thought

25:48.160 --> 25:50.420
you were keeping me trapped in the palace

25:50.810 --> 25:52.510
just to humiliate me.

25:55.000 --> 25:56.190
But I never expected

25:57.480 --> 25:58.610
that you would

25:59.830 --> 26:01.690
turn against your own kind for me.

26:05.960 --> 26:06.800
Xiao Yao.

26:09.960 --> 26:10.680
I was wrong.

26:21.400 --> 26:22.440
Between us,

26:23.160 --> 26:24.890
there's no need for hostility.

26:26.450 --> 26:27.520
If you're willing,

26:28.790 --> 26:30.460
let's start as friends,

26:31.200 --> 26:32.110
alright?

26:34.330 --> 26:36.030
I can also promise you.

26:36.880 --> 26:37.990
As long as I'm here,

26:38.480 --> 26:40.880
the dragons won't harm any humans.

26:53.720 --> 26:54.920
Be careful next time!

26:55.200 --> 26:56.350
If you leave the water again,

26:56.350 --> 26:58.210
you'll end up on someone's plate.

27:01.640 --> 27:03.590
Fortunately, it met a kind Water Dragon.

27:03.590 --> 27:04.980
and survived.

27:05.590 --> 27:07.850
If you can treat the aquatic folk kindly,

27:07.880 --> 27:09.880
why can't you treat humans the same?

27:10.160 --> 27:11.420
They don't deserve it.

27:11.750 --> 27:12.350
Why?

27:14.640 --> 27:16.920
Humans are the lowest beings in the world,

27:16.920 --> 27:18.240
without a trace of power.

27:18.240 --> 27:20.770
Not having spiritual power
makes them lowly?

27:23.580 --> 27:24.830
Because of my birthday,

27:24.830 --> 27:26.630
so many people died for nothing.

27:27.270 --> 27:28.680
Even an Azure Dragon

27:28.920 --> 27:30.030
might not be able to bear the karma

27:30.030 --> 27:32.270
of so much killing.

27:33.480 --> 27:35.900
If you lose reverence for life,

27:36.000 --> 27:37.880
how can dragon
command respect from others?

27:37.880 --> 27:39.070
As an Azure Dragon,

27:39.510 --> 27:41.510
what kind of beings am I protecting?

27:46.400 --> 27:47.270
The world

27:47.510 --> 27:49.370
doesn't just consist of dragons.

27:49.550 --> 27:51.210
If you don't understand this,

27:51.480 --> 27:53.570
you'll always be a little dragon,

27:53.750 --> 27:56.000
and never become a true Long Yu.

28:00.720 --> 28:02.500
Thank you for your guidance, Dragon Lord.

28:02.500 --> 28:04.960
I'll go practice my cultivation
right away.

28:17.520 --> 28:18.800
What you said to him—

28:19.880 --> 28:21.000
was it true?

28:22.400 --> 28:23.130
Of course.

28:29.600 --> 28:31.230
I'm feeling much better now

28:31.480 --> 28:32.810
and want to go for a walk.

28:34.880 --> 28:36.610
Do you want me to accompany you?

28:37.190 --> 28:37.640
Mm.

28:52.000 --> 28:53.460
What are you listening to?

28:55.110 --> 28:56.240
The sound of the sea.

29:06.960 --> 29:08.160
You can really hear it.

29:08.160 --> 29:09.310
This conch shell

29:09.590 --> 29:11.240
has only a trace of power,

29:11.750 --> 29:14.610
but it still lets you feel
the presence of the ocean.

29:15.130 --> 29:16.640
But its power is too small,

29:17.640 --> 29:19.030
just like humans.

29:20.510 --> 29:23.070
The law of nature
is survival of the fittest.

29:23.860 --> 29:25.990
But humans refuse to accept this fate.

29:27.030 --> 29:29.560
We will find ways
to make ourselves stronger.

29:33.960 --> 29:35.820
Have you heard of the Yuli Spring?

29:46.280 --> 29:48.010
I was originally a human prince

29:49.160 --> 29:51.560
who moved the deity
during a heaven ritual.

29:51.910 --> 29:54.090
To free humans from our short lives

29:54.960 --> 29:56.960
and from being oppressed by demons,

29:57.960 --> 29:59.820
the deity opened a divine spring

30:00.640 --> 30:02.700
on the celestial mountain in the sea,

30:02.720 --> 30:03.730
called Yuli.

30:05.590 --> 30:07.080
Drink from this spring,

30:08.000 --> 30:10.060
and humans can achieve immortality.

30:11.770 --> 30:12.850
Unfortunately,

30:14.070 --> 30:14.880
we humans have to

30:14.880 --> 30:17.140
find the celestial mountain ourselves.

30:19.680 --> 30:21.040
So even ten thousand years ago,

30:21.040 --> 30:22.720
everyone was already
exhausting their energy

30:22.720 --> 30:24.380
to search for the Yuli Spring.

30:29.180 --> 30:31.310
Have you assembled the Kunlun Mirror?

30:33.680 --> 30:34.740
The Kunlun Mirror?

30:36.310 --> 30:37.310
Never heard of it.

30:38.070 --> 30:40.930
Then how did you search
for the celestial mountain?

30:41.380 --> 30:43.780
We put all our efforts
into building a ship,

30:44.390 --> 30:46.110
hoping to try our luck at sea.

30:47.360 --> 30:48.440
But unexpectedly,

30:49.750 --> 30:51.480
we soon encountered a tsunami.

30:55.030 --> 30:55.830
So

30:56.550 --> 30:58.190
that's how we met

30:58.210 --> 30:59.130
on the shore.

31:04.590 --> 31:05.070
Yes.

31:12.310 --> 31:15.040
We will definitely find
the celestial mountain.

31:28.590 --> 31:30.250
Humans are truly delusional.

31:30.350 --> 31:32.550
The seas have always
belonged to us dragons.

31:32.550 --> 31:33.880
I've roamed these waters for years,

31:33.880 --> 31:35.240
and I've never seen a celestial mountain,

31:35.240 --> 31:36.640
only scattered islands.

31:36.960 --> 31:37.590
Besides,

31:37.590 --> 31:39.110
the ships built by humans

31:39.110 --> 31:40.120
are really crude.

31:40.400 --> 31:42.030
One strong wind and they fall apart.

31:42.030 --> 31:43.830
They can't even reach the deep waters,

31:43.830 --> 31:45.890
let alone find a celestial mountain.

31:46.240 --> 31:47.400
That's why I said

31:47.590 --> 31:49.350
dragons should help with the search.

31:49.350 --> 31:50.160
What do human affairs

31:50.160 --> 31:51.880
have to do with us dragons?

31:53.070 --> 31:53.790
Long Yu accepts the order.

31:53.790 --> 31:54.850
I'll go search now.

31:56.470 --> 31:58.900
Has this kid gone mad in his cultivation?

31:59.640 --> 32:01.200
If the little dragon goes alone

32:01.200 --> 32:03.140
and encounters a great demon,

32:03.350 --> 32:04.160
I'm afraid...

32:07.590 --> 32:08.270
Yes.

32:08.480 --> 32:10.010
Long Zhi accepts the order.

32:21.590 --> 32:22.430
This boat

32:22.890 --> 32:24.290
is from the dragons?

32:24.880 --> 32:27.010
Dragons don't need boats.

32:27.160 --> 32:28.790
This was all I could find.

32:59.200 --> 33:00.980
Would you please talk to me?

33:01.070 --> 33:02.350
Such a handsome face,

33:02.350 --> 33:03.270
sitting there in silence,

33:03.270 --> 33:05.330
it's like you're guarding my spirit.

33:11.160 --> 33:13.000
I once received a divine vision too.

33:13.000 --> 33:14.030
Would you like to know

33:14.030 --> 33:14.960
what I saw?

33:18.920 --> 33:21.440
I saw what my future husband looks like.

33:22.720 --> 33:23.520
You...

33:23.550 --> 33:25.610
You are my destined husband.

33:30.550 --> 33:31.510
The deity

33:31.790 --> 33:32.850
is supreme.

33:33.350 --> 33:36.100
How could they give such personal
romantic revelations?

33:36.100 --> 33:37.160
Don't you have

33:37.480 --> 33:40.160
customs for praying for marriage blessings

33:40.160 --> 33:41.750
or fertility goddesses or something?

33:41.750 --> 33:42.400
No.

33:44.880 --> 33:46.240
We aren't even married yet.

33:46.240 --> 33:48.300
What's all this talk about children?

33:49.070 --> 33:49.920
I see.

33:51.400 --> 33:53.660
But the fact is you'll become my husband.

34:02.000 --> 34:04.060
Humans are still suffering greatly.

34:05.550 --> 34:07.680
I can't think about personal romance.

34:18.510 --> 34:19.040
Don't be afraid.

34:19.040 --> 34:20.420
Sit tight. I'm here.

34:36.170 --> 34:36.900
Hold on to me.

34:43.530 --> 34:44.230
Hold tight.

34:50.830 --> 34:52.560
Hong Ye has survived a tsunami.

34:52.630 --> 34:53.630
At this moment,

34:53.630 --> 34:55.080
he must be frightened.

34:55.889 --> 34:57.590
But he thought first

34:58.090 --> 34:59.470
of my safety.

35:07.970 --> 35:08.770
It's okay now.

35:09.040 --> 35:09.510
Mm.

35:22.110 --> 35:23.510
They all treat me

35:23.510 --> 35:25.510
like an all-powerful Azure Dragon.

35:25.630 --> 35:26.510
Only you

35:27.060 --> 35:29.270
protect me like an ordinary woman.

35:30.360 --> 35:31.110
Thank you.

35:34.010 --> 35:35.120
I'm a man.

35:46.810 --> 35:47.860
The oars are gone.

35:49.670 --> 35:50.760
If the oars are gone,

35:50.760 --> 35:52.190
let this boat

35:52.910 --> 35:54.350
drift with the waves.

35:55.150 --> 35:56.880
There won't be any more danger.

35:58.750 --> 35:59.450
Mm.

36:32.820 --> 36:35.150
The current Hong Ye has no power

36:35.450 --> 36:36.980
and is oppressed by demons,

36:37.020 --> 36:38.800
yet in moments of danger,

36:38.800 --> 36:40.710
he still protects me with his life.

36:40.710 --> 36:42.110
How could someone like him

36:42.110 --> 36:43.480
be the evil man

36:43.480 --> 36:46.410
that the Qiong Qis speak of
thousands of years later?

37:14.880 --> 37:15.680
You're awake.

37:20.910 --> 37:21.810
Thank you.

37:25.630 --> 37:26.490
What about you?

37:28.040 --> 37:29.040
You didn't sleep?

37:38.710 --> 37:39.270
Look!

37:39.480 --> 37:41.340
There's a fishing village ahead.

37:41.800 --> 37:42.660
Are you hungry?

37:42.680 --> 37:43.550
I'll find a house

37:43.550 --> 37:45.480
and make you something delicious.

37:47.190 --> 37:47.550
Hmm,

37:47.960 --> 37:48.620
I'm hungry.

37:57.020 --> 37:57.850
They say

37:57.950 --> 37:59.210
the owner of this house

37:59.410 --> 38:01.480
went to sea
and was never heard from again.

38:01.480 --> 38:02.760
Let's rest here.

38:03.000 --> 38:05.150
I didn't think that you could cook.

38:06.160 --> 38:06.760
Of course.

38:07.630 --> 38:08.720
I'm a man.

38:16.700 --> 38:18.270
The conditions here are far more modest

38:18.270 --> 38:19.400
than in the Dragon Palace.

38:19.400 --> 38:20.660
You'll have to make do.

38:22.000 --> 38:24.100
My old place wasn't even this nice.

38:28.880 --> 38:29.880
It smells so good.

38:31.030 --> 38:31.960
This fragrance,

38:32.230 --> 38:35.030
I could smell it every day
and never get tired of it.

38:41.960 --> 38:42.550
Drink slowly.

38:42.550 --> 38:43.070
Mm.

38:43.070 --> 38:44.130
Careful, it's hot.

38:52.170 --> 38:52.910
Delicious.

38:55.590 --> 38:57.880
But just soup alone won't fill me up.

39:00.190 --> 39:01.990
Make me a bowl of noodles please.

39:02.710 --> 39:04.190
What are noodles?

39:06.970 --> 39:07.600
Oh, right.

39:07.630 --> 39:09.000
They don't exist yet.

39:10.360 --> 39:11.630
They're delicious.

39:11.710 --> 39:12.800
I'll teach you how to make them.

39:12.800 --> 39:14.200
Go find some wheat flour.

39:16.920 --> 39:17.440
Okay.

39:36.120 --> 39:38.890
♪ Cliffside streams flow, pine scents
fill my sleeves as I sleep ♪

39:40.400 --> 39:43.010
♪ What year will cranes return?
The moss covers another tower ♪

39:44.620 --> 39:47.330
♪ Brew iced moon springs,
the stone pot brims with sunset glows ♪

39:48.590 --> 39:51.420
♪ Wind sweeps the empty court;
writing the seasons ♪

39:53.170 --> 39:55.910
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

39:57.370 --> 40:00.230
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue ♪

40:01.690 --> 40:04.580
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

40:05.760 --> 40:08.410
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

40:12.140 --> 40:15.300
♪ Cool dew freezes the day,
mist and rain veil the drifting boat ♪

40:16.510 --> 40:19.750
♪ Eternal night won't stay, but thankfully
there are memories to keep ♪

40:20.940 --> 40:23.940
♪ Moon shifts stars, wind stirs
curtains at the window ♪

40:25.230 --> 40:28.140
♪ Waiting only for a glance
from you in this lifetime ♪

40:29.310 --> 40:31.930
♪ Holding your hand, we watch
the shifting stars together ♪

40:32.960 --> 40:35.980
♪ I brew years of romance
and longing into wine ♪

40:37.070 --> 40:41.190
♪ Holding your hand, we roam free
and happy together ♪

40:42.210 --> 40:44.910
♪ Eternal sorrows end, the broken cocoon
becomes an ark ♪

40:45.990 --> 40:48.980
♪ Holding your hand, we watch
the shifting stars together ♪

40:49.940 --> 40:53.160
♪ I boil away my worries
with dew and strands of hair ♪

40:54.090 --> 40:58.180
♪ Holding your hand, we roam free
and happy together ♪

40:59.400 --> 41:02.850
♪ Three lives of joy,
growing old with one heart ♪
